// Gap G60 (Codex review of W4-1, finding 2): a whole reassignment of a
// deferred alias (`g2 = y`) is a write through a deferred computation, which
// has no storage of its own. The lanes disagreed on whether the old value is
// evaluated first (the llvm lane dropped its failure); the write is now
